      "content": "hey i just got the most insane headache out of nowhere. like it hit me like a ton of bricks in like 2 seconds. it's the worst pain i've ever felt but i get really bad migraines all the time so maybe it's just a really nasty one? i'm kinda scared but hoping i don't have to go to the er",
